Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:03.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:07.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这边 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,驾 驾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:21.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要摘下他的面具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然生前没能看到真容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:29.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那么死后也不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:31.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,闭棺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:54.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁能来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:23.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我怕是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:33.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:39.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:40.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,简直一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:41.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀永安王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:45.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保仙乐遗民
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀安乐王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保两族不再起纷争
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:51.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死于郎千秋之手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凶手伏诛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:56.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三条人命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,换几世太平
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:04:59.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:06.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁也不会做得比你更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:08.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是觉得不应该
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那些真心诚意付出了善意的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不应该落得这样的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪怕是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,至少我想让千秋相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一往无前去做对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就会有好的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而不是现在这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一切都变成了谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,变成了骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,胡说八道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:47.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我自己受够了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就不想别人也再受一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但是你看这世上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多么可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安前面几代皇族
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒行逆施都没有不得善终
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而到了郎千秋父母这辈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:09.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一心想挽救残局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做点大事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却是这种下场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我真忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那一剑刺去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是戚容和安乐王的错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本来一切都是好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郎千秋的父皇登位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一改先代打压仙乐遗民之风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:47.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐永安两族的百姓也逐渐接纳了彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,眼看一切有了转机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安乐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:03.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知不知道你犯下了大错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:05.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来你是国师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你藏得也太深了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起去干一番大事业
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:15.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在洗了鎏金宴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:17.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再去杀了郎千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搅的永安翻天覆地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永无安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:23.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀了就是杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,即便有再冠冕堂皇的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再多的迫不得已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:33.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也改变不了这一事实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:36.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戚容有一点说得挺对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是挺失败的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那种废物的话你可别信
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他除了打不死跑得快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,八百多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连个绝都混不上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打他都嫌手脏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如此说来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我岂不也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原本再见到郎千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发现他依旧是从前那直来直去的性子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:03.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有些欣慰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但这次冲击之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知他会变成怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,追击完戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回来又会如何与我了结
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这巢穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕是还藏了不少活人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:41.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先救他们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:08:59.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:02.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这最后一批
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:05.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是是是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有人来救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们放我们出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:20.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:22.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走快走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:28.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:31.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鎏金宴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当初我只道是安乐王一手策划
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但未曾想幕后是戚容指使
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:39.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而你是如何得知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:42.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又是多早之前知晓的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:46.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不算早
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我跟戚容打过几次交道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,清楚他的底细和手段
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐遗民数次针对永安皇族的暗杀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是他在背后操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只不过藏得很好罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来他早有前科
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:04.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如此插手人间事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天庭若是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:07.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,早饶不了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:10.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而血洗鎏金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:12.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,符合戚容一贯的行事风格
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:14.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以我本以为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,芳心国师是他派的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郎千秋指认芳心国师是你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那么芳心便不可能和戚容一派
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:31.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,似乎十分清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:35.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我和戚容之间的渊源
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:36.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过节
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以我更倾向于主使者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:39.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,至少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一定是他先动的手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐永安毕竟是同源
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,普通的仙乐遗民
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,境遇得到改善后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:52.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便不会再整天想着复仇复国
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而唯一戚容能鼓动作乱的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就只剩下仙乐皇室唯一的后人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安乐王了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:05.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,偏生这人在鎏金宴后不久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:06.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就莫名其妙病逝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如此凑巧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:10.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,岂非蹊跷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以初步推测
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是仙乐皇族所杀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但之后却又不见仙乐遗民
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:18.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受牵连遭殃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这就不合理了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:23.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,思来想去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便只剩下现在这个结论了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:27.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,线索这么少
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,亏你竟能推得八九不离十啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:31.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不难
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是足够了解罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,的确是很了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过这里面有一个很重要的前提
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:46.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么你如此相信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:47.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鎏金宴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:49.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就一定是戚容先动的手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我并非相信一定是他做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只是确信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一定不是你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:00.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:03.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为你承认血洗鎏金宴的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安国主为政勤恳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,深得民心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:09.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你却说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看不得他们坐在这个位置上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,确实是很标准的篡位者宣言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但出自你口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就是拙劣的自污了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:22.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自污
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可万一我心底深处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真就是那么想的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你也不会那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:37.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我并非是你所想象的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:39.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,无妨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要把某个人想象得太过美好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:49.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若一辈子只是远观倒也罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-一旦靠近 相识相知\N-去你的仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:54.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你祖祖辈辈世世代代
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-完美的幻影\N-都是仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-终究会有破碎的一天\N-瘟神 他就是个瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我妻儿的命还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-到那时候你会很失望的\N-还命来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别人失不失望我不关心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但对一些人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,某人存在于这世上本身
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:14.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是希望
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:17.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:19.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知道戚容是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也知道我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你似乎对我知道很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我岂非一直都知道很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我总有一种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:35.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我一位故人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也许相识于我第一次飞升的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:44.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也许更早
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:46.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:48.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:51.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我见过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:03.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼的真名都是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:07.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会随便告诉别人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:10.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只是随口一问
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是谁都没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就说了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,化个女相别说法力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:20.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连手气都更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还不肯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次投对了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:27.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:30.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哎哟我去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:49.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:14:59.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:03.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有话好好说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先把兵器收起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:15.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:16.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:18.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你别乱来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:20.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你那极乐坊是不小心烧的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是有什么不满
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱们商量商量赔你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君还不至于赔不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:27.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放了太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:28.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一切好说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:31.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怕是有所误会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:32.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:38.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,君吾往我手底下安插眼线的事我还没清算
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们拿什么跟我谈条件
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:51.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别演了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎是好意救我才闯的仙京
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:55.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何必掩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:58.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不演啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正方才那两句
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我已经传到通灵阵去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:07.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这传来传去好意都能曲解成恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不如一开始就是恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们反而就信了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:12.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明白人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要不然本风师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么在上天庭混
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:20.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:21.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放下弓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人家熟着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你身旁那个是绝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:30.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么一个两个都听不进去劝的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:35.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快把弓放下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我靠了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还没问你想干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:40.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你你刚才拿什么撞的我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:43.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都说了他是去救太子殿下的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:44.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还拿箭指人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-靠 我真的靠了\N-这么想打架
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本风师可不奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:49.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不要再做这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要再做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这反应
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:56.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不至于吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:57.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:58.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别再过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:01.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行行行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:02.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你赶紧给我变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-听到没有\N-你这什么态度嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你也不吃亏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:16.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:19.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他没在通灵阵里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:19.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我后来追问了他好几次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他都没和我应声
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以往千秋就算是小神官找
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:27.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也会立刻应答的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:30.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次真是奇了怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰华殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是去追戚容了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此处正是戚容的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他只是去追血洗鎏金宴真正的凶手了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真正的凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:46.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有点复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:50.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回去我再细说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:53.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是误会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:55.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本风师真是料事如神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这下他回去也不用关禁闭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:17:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:00.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:03.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实戚容就是那个戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们都认识的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:12.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会有鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脑袋上顶着自己的真名到处招摇过市
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:17.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这不是有病吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们认识青鬼本人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:28.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我表弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:29.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:31.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他确实相当厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:34.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是说太子殿下你厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:38.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,东南武神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,西南武神是你旧识
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,东方武神是你徒弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,青灯夜游是你表亲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:49.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这鬼市老大血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:51.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是你拜把子的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:53.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有本风师是你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:55.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这还不厉害吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师可真人如其名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:01.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,清风过境
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阴霾就都被吹散了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:10.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总之要没别的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还是赶紧回仙京吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,闹那么大一出
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君那边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:15.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你总得有个交代
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还道是性子有多直
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来也是个说话拐弯抹角的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:26.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不就是让太子殿下\N别和我这种妖魔鬼怪混作一路吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:27.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何不敢直说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:31.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕没资格立场说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:32.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他本就不该
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知道就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:35.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我会给个交代的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:40.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:41.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有些事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方才多亏三郎帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才把被戚容困在这的活人给放走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,目前还剩下一批小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,处理完我就上去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拖太久不好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先上去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以上天庭的效率
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:01.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大概下个月就可以处理完了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说得你一瞬间就能了结似的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:06.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:07.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他俩有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:18.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:19.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你干什么撑伞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:21.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,马上就要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:26.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,变天了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:39.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪来的雨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:42.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,停了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:53.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:54.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么跟个木桩子似的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:56.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不躲躲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:01.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:03.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再擦擦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:04.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脸上都沾到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:05.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:08.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说好的一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:10.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:12.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行了行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:14.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这拂尘的毛都快抹我一脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:23.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要回鬼市了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:25.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是也要回仙京了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要是想跟我回鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:32.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:34.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有机会你重修极乐坊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:38.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去给你搬砖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:43.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搬砖不必
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你坐着看也挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:48.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:51.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是多谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎样才是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或许
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:00.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这样也未尝不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.63,0:22:01.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你只管做就是了
